cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this repository helps your work, cite the paper it audits first and this repository second."
title: "Separatrix calibration demo"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible audit of the entropy-driven refinement step in
  Crabtree et al. (2026), "Generative Learning of Separatrices"
  (arXiv:2608.14743). Measures two failure modes of the chain
  (unreachable buried islands, unresolved peninsulas), the resolution
  criteria that predict them, and a population-shift trap in the metric
  the refinement is usually evaluated with.
